sequenceDiagram
    participant Page as Screen (+page.svelte)
    participant Api as api.ts (callRow / callTable)
    participant Route as routes/call.ts (POST /api/call)
    participant Dispatch as call-dispatch/*.ts entry
    participant Db as db.ts function

    Page->>Api: postOnAccountInvoice({...})
    Api->>Route: text/csv body: name,values... then one line per line item
    Route->>Dispatch: positional values, line items, user
    Dispatch->>Dispatch: requireRole, check and brand the values
    Dispatch->>Db: postOnAccountInvoice(input, userId)
    Db-->>Dispatch: result (or ValidationError / NotFoundError)
    Dispatch-->>Route: row(...) or table(...) (or CallError 4xx)
    Route-->>Api: "ok,..." line, or header + rows, or "error,message"
    Api-->>Page: parsed value, or throws ApiError
